        "body": "## Summary\n\n- send non-streaming `output_format` as an ElevenLabs query parameter instead of an unsupported JSON field\n- stop retrying client errors and cancellations; make hard timeouts cancellation-safe\n- align speed validation with the provider-supported `0.7...1.2` range and apply validation in the example app\n- cancel superseded MP3/PCM stream consumers and isolate stale PCM buffer completions from replacement playback\n- update CI to the released `actions/checkout@v7` and make Xcode discovery shellcheck-clean\n\nProvider contracts checked against:\n\n- https://elevenlabs.io/docs/api-reference/text-to-speech/convert\n- https://elevenlabs.io/docs/api-reference/text-to-speech/stream\n- https://elevenlabs.io/docs/overview/capabilities/text-to-speech/best-practices\n- https://github.com/actions/checkout/releases/tag/v7.0.0\n\n## Proof\n\n- `swiftformat Sources Tests Examples --lint`\n- `swiftlint lint --strict --config .swiftlint.yml`\n- `swift test --enable-code-coverage -Xswiftc -warnings-as-errors` — 37 tests passed\n- `./scripts/check-coverage.sh 70` — 76.01%\n- root, SwiftUI example, and CLI builds with warnings as errors\n- `actionlint .github/workflows/ci.yml`\n- source-blind local HTTP behavior probe: requested PCM format appeared only in the query; HTTP 400 and canceled slow request each produced one request; hard timeout returned in 0.210s\n- `gitleaks` full working tree and candidate commits — no leaks\n- public model-identifier gate: PASS against current ElevenLabs model documentation\n\n## Remaining gate\n\nAuthenticated ElevenLabs synthesis plus real audio playback proof is still pending because no approved API credential was available in this session. Keep this draft unmerged until that proof is recorded or an explicit item-specific waiver is given.\n",
